.TH xml_delete 3
.SH NAME
xml_delete \- remove and free an XML node and its children
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "void xml_delete(xmlnode *" node ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_delete
recursively deletes the specified
.I node
and all of its descendants. It also unlinks the node from its parent if
it has one, frees its name, destroys its attribute map, and frees the
node memory itself.